            "text": "{\n  \"judgments\": [\n    {\n      \"proposal_id\": \"P0000\",\n      \"source_refs\": [\n        \"F002:F003\",\n        \"F005\"\n      ],\n      \"rationale\": \"Subsection (c) provides that using a hand-held mobile telephone is permissible 'by drivers of a CMV when necessary to communicate with law enforcement officials or other emergency services.' While this qualifies the driver prohibition in § 392.82(a)(1) (C0000), the text does not grant motor carriers an exception to allow or require hand-held mobile telephone use under § 392.82(a)(2) (C0001). Because not every targeted baseline is supported by the source text, the proposal cannot be supported as formulated.\",\n      \"verdict\": \"unsupported\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
